      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْفَرٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْفَارٌ</span></b>  (A, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْفَرَةٌ</span></b>  (K)
<i>A spade;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْحَاةٌ</span>: (K:) <i>an implement for
